OL,3,GNEWSAGavin and Stacey props to be      
OL,4,Aauctioned for cancer charity           
OL,6,FThe memorabilia has been donated by    
OL,7,FTidy Productions, one of the companies 
OL,8,Fbehind the show, to raise money for    
OL,9,FCancer Research Wales - with the online
OL,10,Fauction beginning on Wednesday.        
